Ledgers: agent-safe accounting

Usage: ledgers [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  serve        Start the native Ledgers server
  completions  Generate shell completions
  mcp          Serve MCP over stdio, relaying to the server with your agent key
  accounts     Commands under `ledgers accounts`
  entries      Commands under `ledgers entries`
  reports      Commands under `ledgers reports`
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json            Output machine-readable JSON
      --profile <NAME>  Profile name (default: from LEDGERS_PROFILE or 'default')
      --url <URL>       Server URL (overrides LEDGERS_URL and the profile)
  -h, --help            Print help (see more with '--help')
  -V, --version         Print version

Ledgers is not tax or legal advice. Check rates and returns before you file.
